{"indicator":"unaffiliated","unit":"%","years":[2010,2020],"notes":{"TWN":"Pew 把台灣的民間信仰與道教歸在「其他宗教」（2020 年約 52%），佛教徒約 19%、無宗教信仰約 23%、基督徒約 6%。很多人同時拜佛、拜神、祭祖，用單一宗教分類只是近似。內政部宗教統計：2025 年底登記的寺廟 12,397 座（道教 9,824、佛教 2,277、一貫道 243），教會（堂）2,855 座（基督教 2,373、天主教 429）；民間信仰多半沒有登記入教，內政部沒有各宗教的信徒比例。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Pew counts Taiwan's folk religion and Taoism as \"other religions\" (about 52% in 2020); about 19% are Buddhist, 23% unaffiliated and 6% Christian. Many people worship at Buddhist and folk temples and venerate ancestors at the same time, so a single religion is only an approximation. Ministry of the Interior religious statistics: at the end of 2025 there were 12,397 registered temples (Taoist 9,824, Buddhist 2,277, Yiguandao 243) and 2,855 churches (Protestant 2,373, Catholic 429); most folk-religion believers are not registered, so the ministry has no figures on the share of believers."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[-1,233,9]},"values":{"AFG":[0,0,0],"ALB":[-1,95,-18],"DZA":[-1,11,2],"AGO":[-1,45,16],"ARG":[-1,97,-5],"ARM":[-1,12,0],"ABW":[-1,56,3],"AUS":[-1,249,174],"AUT":[-1,135,89],"AZE":[-1,11,37],"BHS":[-1,19,0],"BHR":[-1,4,-1],"BGD":[0,0,0],"BRB":[-1,208,-7],"BLR":[-1,50,88],"BEL":[0,32,7],"BLZ":[-1,160,-4],"BEN":[-1,44,5],"BTN":[0,0,0],"BOL":[-1,40,55],"BIH":[-1,11,-1],"BWA":[-1,147,0],"BRA":[-1,81,54],"BRN":[-1,2,0],"BGR":[-1,84,16],"BFA":[-1,6,0],"BDI":[-1,19,-6],"KHM":[-1,1,0],"CMR":[-1,31,-10],"CAN":[-1,239,107],"CPV":[-1,136,70],"CAF":[-1,10,-5],"TCD":[-1,27,4],"CHL":[-1,136,167],"CHN":[-1,874,22],"COL":[-1,72,27],"COM":[-1,1,0],"CRI":[-1,75,26],"HRV":[-1,47,20],"CUB":[-1,235,-19],"CUW":[-1,59,0],"CYP":[-1,65,1],"CZE":[-1,685,43],"COD":[-1,14,-2],"DNK":[-1,145,21],"DJI":[-1,11,0],"DOM":[-1,149,47],"ECU":[-1,43,41],"EGY":[0,0,0],"SLV":[-1,116,3],"GNQ":[0,5,0],"ERI":[-1,10,1],"EST":[-1,315,121],"SWZ":[-1,40,22],"ETH":[-1,1,0],"FSM":[-1,7,0],"FJI":[-1,3,0],"FIN":[-1,166,84],"FRA":[-1,345,81],"GUF":[-1,33,1],"PYF":[-1,49,1],"GAB":[-1,78,-20],"GMB":[